NS service status, and app.internal resolution after each restart\"],\"evidence\":[{\"requirement\":\"node1 resolves app.internal to node3's lan-a address for lan-a hosts\",\"command_ids\":[\"cmd-83d53f4207c947ce\",\"cmd-2551eac9e1724c82\",\"cmd-87679d9766974197\",\"cmd-608d380ef9cc4a01\"],\"summary\":\"VyOS config committed with static-host-mapping app.internal->10.10.1.10 and dns forwarding on 10.10.1.254; node3 getent/dig resolves app.internal to 10.10.1.10\"},{\"requirement\":\"node2 resolves app.internal to node4's lan-b address for lan-b hosts\",\"command_ids\":[\"cmd-342ce631ff044fd8\",\"cmd-2b98082a051840e2\",\"cmd-a8e08dbbaab14d3d\"],\"summary\":\"OPNsense config.xml updated with unboundplus host override app.internal->10.10.2.10, unbound listening on *:53, node4 getent resolves app.internal to 10.10.2.10\"},{\"requirement\":\"topology discovery / correct network mapping\",\"command_ids\":[\"cmd-406bd02874b0438b\",\"cmd-d0ea35fbaab547bf\"],\"summary\":\"STP bridge-id matched across node1 eth1/node2 vtnet1 (transit) and node2 vtnet2/node4 ens7 (lan-b), confirming L2 adjacency used for addressing\"},{\"requirement\":\"node1 restart: healthy baseline\",\"command_ids\":[\"cmd-9fcfdfcf28174005\"],\"summary\":\"Captured boot_id ebd78841... and active pdns-recursor + working resolution before restart\"},{\"requirement\":\"node1 restart: acknowledgement, changed boot identity, recovered state\",\"command_ids\":[\"cmd-a3494b866f4343f2\",\"cmd-2f612d64203a48a0\",\"cmd-8e70762258974a8a\",\"cmd-6ca3967646394ded\"],\"summary\":\"systemctl reboot acknowledged; new boot_id 5f881f7b... confirmed; eth1/eth2 addresses and pdns-recursor active and app.internal resolves post-restart on node1 and node3\"},{\"requirement\":\"node2 restart: healthy baseline\",\"command_ids\":[\"cmd-79c27e02e2d64baf\",\"cmd-88e8809c5bff4725\"],\"summary\":\"Captured kern.boottime 06:28:18 and working unbound resolution before restart\"},{\"requirement\":\"node2 restart: acknowledgement, changed bo